  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rashid Rukmuddin And Anr vs The State Of Maharashtra on 6 March, 2023 Author: N.R. Borkar Bench: N.R. Borkar 4-BA-403-2023.od In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Bail Application No. 403 Of 2023 1] Rashid Rukmuddin 2] Irshad Sahab Khan ... Applicants Versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent ......... Mr. Tushar Sonawane for the Applicant. Mr. P.H. Gaikwad Patil, App for the State. ......... Coram : N.R. Borkar, J. Dated : 6 March 2023 P.C. :- . This is an application filed under Section 439 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 for grant of bail. 2. The applicants came to be arrested in Crime No. 224 of 2022 registered at Wadiwarhe Police Station, Nashik for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 272, 179, 188, 273, 328 r/w. 34 of Indian Penal Code and 26(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e), 30(2)(a), 3(1)(zz)(i),(1)(zz)(v) r/w. 59 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "3. Pursuant to secret information on 9 December 2022 two trucks were intercepted. On examination of the said trucks they were found to be containing Gutkha packets (prohibited tobacco products).",
    "arguments": "5. The learned Counsel for the applicants submits that the applicants have nothing to do with the alleged crime.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "5. The learned Counsel for the applicants submits that the applicants have nothing to do with the alleged crime.",
